{"detail": {"templateUuid": "5fb08632981940f7920445100b807501", "projectUuid": "629c259f263e4d00a8d5ae3bad65d4fb", "name": "外号", "description": "小时候，我以为外号只是玩笑。后来才懂——取外号，是一群人挑中一个人，用一个词把她钉住。你越急，他们越笑；你越哭，他们越叫。没人觉得在伤人，只说“开不起玩笑”。\n\n可被叫的人，每天低着头，像欠了谁。\n\n所以有了这个故事。\n\n孔融教会我们：话可以驳，但不必把自己变成对方。一句“想君小时，必当了了”，不损人，却让人躲不掉。\n\n孙武教会我们：你一哭、一跑、一还嘴，戏就演下去了。你不演，戏就散了。不用赢他，只要不倒。\n\n孔子教会我们：可我不接他给的名字。他损一句，你回一句；不多，也不少。以直报怨，以德报德。别忍着，也别变成他。\n\n希望天下每一个被起外号的孩子，都不必再低头。\n\n希望天下每一句玩笑，都不再拿别人的名字当刀。", "coverUrl": "/assets/c1eafd6c5e66a64b.webp", "finalOutput": "https://libtv-res.liblib.art/upload-images/5de3ec9ad39e4661a321fb2541360125/c1d3b3537800f1f9276d8de4938d0ebcfe5cedb7.mp4", "snapshotId": 50349, "auditStatus": 1, "ownerId": 6823252, "ownerUuid": "5de3ec9ad39e4661a321fb2541360125", "avatar": "/assets/cc72aba482d6aa16.webp", "nickname": "孔孟道", "isLike": false, "likeCount": 1, "tags": [{"id": 1201, "code": "short_series", "tagLabel": "短片剧集", "parentTag": 1200, "categoryId": 0, "path": "1200/1201/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 1, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 1}, {"id": 1504, "code": "children_edu", "tagLabel": "儿童教育", "parentTag": 1500, "categoryId": 0, "path": "1500/1504/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 4, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 1}], "userTags": [{"tagId": 5001, "name": "先锋", "icon": "/assets/15bcb4d002b68470.webp", "primaryIcon": "/assets/b40570481582e92f.webp", "desc": "LibTV先锋作者", "verifyLevel": 1}], "score": 0, "socialMediaUrl": "4.10 复制打开抖音，看看【孔孟道的作品】小时候，我以为外号只是玩笑。后来才懂——取外号，是... https://v.douyin.com/W_rD-760HqI/ rEu:/ 06/19 :0pm N@J.IV", "createAt": "2026年09月27日 15:16", "updateAt": "2026年09月27日 18:00", "publishAt": "2026年09月27日 15:16", "playCount": 59, "viewCreationProcessCount": 28, "copyCanvasCount": 10, "shareCount": 0, "snapshotPath": "/data/canvas-snapshots/5fb08632981940f7920445100b807501.json.gz", "snapshotSummary": {"nodes": 175, "edges": 522}}, "recommendList": []}